# AstraOS kernel selection (plan §1, §5).
#
# AstraOS ships the distribution-supported kernel from the pinned Debian release
# rather than a hand-rolled kernel tree. The kernel package version that actually
# landed in a build is recorded in the build manifest (plan §24).
#
# Debian trixie provides the 6.12 LTS series as linux-image-amd64.

linux-image-amd64
linux-headers-amd64

# CPU microcode updates (non-free-firmware): deliverable and redistributable.
intel-microcode
amd64-microcode

# Thermal / backlight / battery handling used by the desktop power manager.
thermald
acpi-support
